# CQ13 [Substructure & mooring] What are the possible distributions of mooring lines, and which one does each system use?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?distribution ?label ?usedBy WHERE {
  ?distribution a optimar:MooringLineDistribution ; rdfs:label ?label .
  OPTIONAL { ?usedBy optimar:hasLineDistribution ?distribution }
  FILTER(LANG(?label) = "en")
}
